{
    "title": "Shell: Fuel, Charge & More",
    "description": "The Shell App is designed to help you make the most of your stop!\r\n\r\nFUELS DRIVERS\r\nThis mobile payment application provides a secure and convenient way to pay for fuel at the comfort of your car, as well as purchasing any items inside the store at participating Shell stations in the United States.  \r\n\u2022 You can link your Shell branded credit cards, checking account (via Shell S Pay), PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Samsung Pay, or directly add your credit/debit card: Visa, Mastercard, American Express or Discover. \r\n\u2022 There is a NEW way to pay with Shell eGift card. Add or purchase Shell eGift cards from your app! \r\n\u2022 To pay for fuel outdoors, simply unlock the pump using the app. Or to pay inside the c-store, present the app QR code to the cashier. Either way, you are back on the road in no time. Everything you need is in the app, including loyalty program integration, receipts, offers, and station locator.\r\n\r\nELECTRIC VEHICLE DRIVERS\r\nThe Shell App now supports EV drivers! Drivers using the Shell App can select the EV option to access the Shell Recharge network. The Shell App allows EV drivers to locate the nearest charger, check the station\u2019s charging status, start and stop charging, and easily make in-app payments.\r\n\r\nFUEL REWARDS\u00ae PROGRAM\r\nShell Pay & Save eliminates the need to carry multiple cards, reduces the number of prompts you have to answer, and is integrated with the Fuel Rewards\u00ae program so you can save automatically on every fill up, every day! \r\n\u2022 New to the Shell App? You can earn a one-time 25\u00a2/gal savings by downloading the app and completing your first Shell Pay & Save fuels purchase.\r\n\u2022 All Shell App users earn additional savings for continued use of Shell Pay & Save. You can now customize your savings by choosing to redeem only everyday savings or to use your full rewards balance with Fuel Rewards choice in the Shell App. \r\n\u2022 New loyalty status added, see potential new rewards to gain with Platinum status.\r\nParticipation in the Fuel Rewards program through the Shell App requires you to link a new or existing Fuel Rewards account in the app. See Terms & Conditions for complete details.\r\n\r\nSTATION LOCATOR\r\nFind your nearest Shell station and a list of services quickly and easily, including which stations accept Shell Pay & Save mobile payment",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Shell App is designed to help you make the most of your stop!<br><br>FUELS DRIVERS<br>This mobile payment application provides a secure and convenient way to pay for fuel at the comfort of your car, as well as purchasing any items inside the store at participating Shell stations in the United States.  <br>\u2022 You can link your Shell branded credit cards, checking account (via Shell S Pay), PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Samsung Pay, or directly add your credit/debit card: Visa, Mastercard, American Express or Discover. <br>\u2022 There is a NEW way to pay with Shell eGift card. Add or purchase Shell eGift cards from your app! <br>\u2022 To pay for fuel outdoors, simply unlock the pump using the app. Or to pay inside the c-store, present the app QR code to the cashier. Either way, you are back on the road in no time. Everything you need is in the app, including loyalty program integration, receipts, offers, and station locator.<br><br>ELECTRIC VEHICLE DRIVERS<br>The Shell App now supports EV drivers! Drivers using the Shell App can select the EV option to access the Shell Recharge network. The Shell App allows EV drivers to locate the nearest charger, check the station\u2019s charging status, start and stop charging, and easily make in-app payments.<br><br>FUEL REWARDS\u00ae PROGRAM<br>Shell Pay &amp; Save eliminates the need to carry multiple cards, reduces the number of prompts you have to answer, and is integrated with the Fuel Rewards\u00ae program so you can save automatically on every fill up, every day! <br>\u2022 New to the Shell App? You can earn a one-time 25\u00a2/gal savings by downloading the app and completing your first Shell Pay &amp; Save fuels purchase.<br>\u2022 All Shell App users earn additional savings for continued use of Shell Pay &amp; Save. You can now customize your savings by choosing to redeem only everyday savings or to use your full rewards balance with Fuel Rewards choice in the Shell App. <br>\u2022 New loyalty status added, see potential new rewards to gain with Platinum status.<br>Participation in the Fuel Rewards program through the Shell App requires you to link a new or existing Fuel Rewards account in the app. See Terms &amp; Conditions for complete details.<br><br>STATION LOCATOR<br>Find your nearest Shell station and a list of services quickly and easily, including which stations accept Shell Pay &amp; Save mobile payment",
